  "records": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite Block",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque looks suspicious...I'll check Royal Suite A.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "preserve",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite A",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ashby",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Let's hear how the investigation is going.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What's with this man? That came out of nowhere...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So high and mighty...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant's client?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't believe I'm under any obligation to report to you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't get so worked up. Aren't we citizens of allied nations?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Anglo-Japanese Alliance...an alliance with an overwhelming imbalance of power, though.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Do I get paid for this investigation too?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Your reward is surviving the blast. Isn't that enough? Everyone aboard is fighting for their lives. How can you ask about money at a time like this?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then do it yourself.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog seems to be a secret society in St. Petersburg.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ridiculous.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How's the culprit investigation going?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So-so.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So they are relying on me?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That's the privilege of a rank-and-file worker!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm having trouble. Everyone is so eager to get involved that they're all too cooperative.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Do you think you're the only one having a hard time?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Damn right!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You understand the situation. You are one of the investigators now.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you out of your mind?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Like hell! Don't sit back and say whatever you please!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey, pour our guest some tea. He seems to have forgotten his place.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't think you can keep up that gentleman act forever.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Western tableware always feels cold. I don't care for it. It's too stark...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Doulton bone china. It bears a royal warrant, but its design was influenced by Japanese ceramics. If you think the fault is always outside yourself, you're badly mistaken.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How very English. The history of English tea was built on the exploitation of Asia.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You are quite uncouth, Mr. Yamada.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "And you don't even know Ogasawara-style etiquette!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Earl Grey, is it? You English certainly know how to live. Even with ruin at your doorstep, you're calm.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Did you come here to pick a fight?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What if I did?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't get carried away. This is a warning.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Of course. How could I possibly defy you, my lord?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You are remarkably roundabout, Mr. Yamada. And unpleasant.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see. Then I'll ignore your order to fabricate a culprit from among the crew. That's not very gentlemanly.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "When the Great Japanese Empire went to war with Russia, did you not come crying to Britain and Her Majesty the Queen for aid, knowing you could not prevail alone?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "And even now, you remain under my control.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Now I understand why Englishmen only love dogs.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Your trainer must have been lamentable. You still have not learned the proper relation between master and servant.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The English always have to be on top these days.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Managing the whole world is no small burden. I wonder whether even the savages under our protection can comprehend it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The alliance was formed on equal terms. When Russia reached into Asia, Britain was the one actually threatened. If Japan had been crushed, Britain's Asian colonies would not have remained hers alone forever. The Japanese were used.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Even now, you are not at liberty to defy me.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Banzai, British Empire! Banzai, Japanese Empire! Banzai, bomber!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey, see Yamada out.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Where is your room?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The attendant's room is across the hall. The adjoining room is unused. The room at the far end is occupied by Braque's secretary.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque's secret...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Thank you. I think we will get along.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A gentleman does not gulp his tea like that. Excuse me.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "As long as you can drink it, who cares?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'll study it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Adjoining Room C",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ruthie",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque has an abnormal obsession with art. I've heard about the Russian Fog too.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog...so that was the secret in St. Petersburg!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Scary voice...I feel like I'm being scolded...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Georges Braque is like a tyrant. Why did you become his secretary?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So...are you interested in my private life?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Exactly...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What do you mean by Braque's abnormal obsession?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "With him...if getting what he wanted required murder, I think he might even kill.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A woman, perhaps...striking and slender...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Your employer is an awful man. He treats people like things.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You're in a bad mood...taking it out on me?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I'll admit it. I'm irritated.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Paris doesn't leave a beautiful woman alone. Surely someone like you had any number of more worthwhile jobs?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What, even an artist's wife? Honestly, I'd rather be scrubbing with a rag and have a passerby whistle, 'Hey, beautiful.' Sorry. I hate having my work judged by my looks...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "She's a good woman.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What was he doing today?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "In the Second-Class Cabin...I think.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He had breakfast with Ilyusha Grancelius,",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "and I think he stayed in his room after that.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ilyu?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You can really stand talking to Braque. I would snap in ten seconds.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Heh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You're an optimist, aren't you?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque is a collector.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes. I know.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Thank you. You have told me quite a lot.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I want this frightening incident solved as quickly as possible...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Besides...I do not like Braque. He is rather vulgar.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Do you despise a secretary like me?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...no.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Considering who your boss is, I can't blame you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Please do not tell him what I said.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I hate my current boss too.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Heh...you are a good person.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "One more thing. What was Braque asking Ilyu about?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You drew a picture in Center Hall, did you not?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I copied an Alphonse Mucha poster. I told you I was a student at an art school in Paris, didn't I?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque bought my talent and offered to be my patron. He has a weakness for young women who paint...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He's just adding another slave...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you jealous?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Hey...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Fine.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That's just how the business works.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Still, I didn't expect Ilyusha to be an art-school student...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Do you know her?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...Braque's behavior is troubling...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "She's in the cabin next to mine, in second class on the port side. She absolutely cleaned me out at cards.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see...second class really is the way to travel. You make companions. I'm jealous. You'd better warn her: Braque isn't interested in her artistic talent, but in her legs.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'll remember that.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Promenade Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Braque is one possibility.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He's the only one openly after the Russian Fog...but...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Somehow...it just doesn't click.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What is that supposed to mean?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't think he could devise a plan this elaborate...his methods are far too crude.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "One more thing. First-Class Cabin B was unoccupied.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kirikov Kamorovich. A Russian. He was at Bar Hokusai. Something strange?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No...so you do work after all. Sorry. I apologize for laughing.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Never mind. I was only watching to make sure you weren't going around hiding evidence of your own crime. Kirikov refuses to say anything about his background. He's a creepy fellow.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Tch. I wasted that compliment.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He was in the bar at the time of the crime. I want to rule him out.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ask the Russian about the Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kirikov and Stravinsky...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What's with Kirikov?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He was terrified. When I mentioned the secret, he panicked. When I pressed him, he screamed, 'Those are cursed words! Anyone pursued by them will perish!'",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't want to get too involved with Russians these days.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't get it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Stravinsky, the Russian composer you spoke with, may know something. Go.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...guess I don't have a choice.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes, sir.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
